Package: edjobs
Title: Shared Code for State Education Jobs Dashboards
Version: 0.71.0
Authors@R: person("Mike", "Bostick", email = "michael.bostick@montana.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Code shared by state education jobs dashboards (today Montana
    and Wyoming): platform and site-family scrapers, posting classification and
    posted pay, posting spells and listing durations, federal context sources,
    the daily presence check, the checks each weekly run makes on its own output,
    and shared app helpers. What differs by state comes in as data through
    state_config(). Each state repository pins a tagged version.
